Error [E3014]: `foreign function failed: panic: a foreign function panicked`
  --> tests/ui/runtime_e3014.jet:6:5
    |
6 |     panic_now("foreign failure")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The foreign implementation or its ABI boundary rejected the call, so Jet stopped instead of fabricating a result.
 Fix: Fix the foreign function or handle its documented failure before calling it again.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3014
